# The client's raw source library: 200+ MB of 6000px originals and a 19 MB
# master video. Kept on disk, deliberately out of git so the repo stays pushable.
# Everything the site ships is generated from it into assets/ by
# tools/build-images.mjs and tools/build-video.mjs. Add Git LFS if this library
# needs to be versioned too.
brand assets/*
!brand assets/brand.md

# Per article and per project content folders the client drops in: manuscripts
# and full size originals. Same deal as brand assets, the shipped derivatives
# are generated into assets/img by tools/build-images.mjs.
articles/
reference-projects/
